  "description": "YITAMOTOR is of worldwide manufacturer and marketer of automobile parts, We stand on producing quality and high-performance auto parts for over 10 years, and earn a reputation among our customers around the world. We are proud to provide superior-quality auto parts.\nFitment\n2018-2026 Jeep Wrangler JL 4 Door(Excl JK Model)\nFeatures\nFitment: These side steps nerf bars are built for 2018 2019 2020 2021 2022 2023 2024 2025 2026 Jeep Wrangler JL 4 Door (Please check the model before ordering.)\nSturdy Material: Sturdy, durable and corrosion resistance running boards. These textured black ABS plastic side steps can prevent slipping and withstand the toughest weather conditions. Each side can handle up to 450lb (200kg)\nEasy To Install: To make installation easier, DIY installation manual has been improved, which with a detailed combination of graphics and text. Easy bolt-on installation and No drilling or cutting required\nCustomized Kit: Each mounting kit is engineered specifically for your vehicle's design. The pedals are designed to be the perfect length and height for your vehicle, enhancing your car's appearance and making entry and exit easier\nPackage Included: 2 Jeep running boards, relevant hardware, and detailed installation instructions\nProfessional installation recommended",
